- [ ] **Step 6: POST a valid item — expect 201**

```bash
curl -i -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/todolists/1/todoitems \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"description": "Buy milk"}'
```
Expected: `HTTP/1.1 201 Created`.

- [ ] **Step 7: PUT an empty `Description` on the item — expect 400**

```bash
curl -i -X PUT http://localhost:5000/api/todolists/1/todoitems/1 \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"description": "", "isCompleted": false}'
```
Expected: `HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request` with `errors.Description` populated.

